{"4839200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Breachers: Outbreak", "steam_appid": 4839200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You already know how to breach; now you will learn how to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the universe of <i>Breachers</i>, <strong>Breachers: Outbreak</strong> is a 4-player co-op zombie extraction shooter where you and your friends are dropped into infected quarantine zones to recover the key to preventing an undead apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fully cross-play with friends across flatscreen and VR, so how you play is up to you!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXTRACT OR BE OVERRUN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter infected hostile zones, upgrade your arsenal, locate Patient X, and prepare for extraction. Equipped with a bone marrow extractor, you and your friends are tasked with collecting the key component to a cure that could stop The Outbreak dead in its tracks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/74659dad963d6bc4d87bed06c92125a5.poster.avif?t=1782237445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/74659dad963d6bc4d87bed06c92125a5.webm?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/74659dad963d6bc4d87bed06c92125a5.mp4?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GEAR UP</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build loadouts around your playstyle with weapons, gadgets, and specialized equipment pulled from the Breachers universe, adapted for surviving the end of the world. Furthermore, choose your perk and add mod chips to your weaponry to achieve terrifying force with which to mow down entire zombie hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/7ca3e291a13696afccbfa0ee6b96ec8b.poster.avif?t=1782237445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/7ca3e291a13696afccbfa0ee6b96ec8b.webm?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/7ca3e291a13696afccbfa0ee6b96ec8b.mp4?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ERADICATE THE INFECTED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is your squad ready to face unpredictable infected encounters, escalating threat levels, and moments where the entire mission turns against you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/da519f647e250fdf93dda42fda5a47c7.poster.avif?t=1782237445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/da519f647e250fdf93dda42fda5a47c7.webm?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/da519f647e250fdf93dda42fda5a47c7.mp4?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WELCOME TO THE OUTBREAK</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ESTF subsidiary biotech company called Photonix experimented with something they shouldn’t have. Whatever they were working on? It got out and turned the living into undead monstrosities. In response, the ESTF is deploying a special division among their ranks, trained to deal with these kinds of threats and contain them. You and your friends are a part of this division.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/329d7105be3038dd10f4569beb6914e1.poster.avif?t=1782237445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/329d7105be3038dd10f4569beb6914e1.webm?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/329d7105be3038dd10f4569beb6914e1.mp4?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Band together to fight The Outbreak!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/b5cfbae958214e487de55685f17cb09c.poster.avif?t=1782237445\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/b5cfbae958214e487de55685f17cb09c.webm?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4839200/extras/b5cfbae958214e487de55685f17cb09c.mp4?t=1782237445\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You already know how to breach; now you will learn how to survive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the universe of <i>Breachers</i>, <strong>Breachers: Outbreak</strong> is a 4-player co-op zombie extraction shooter where you and your friends are dropped into infected quarantine zones to recover the key to preventing an undead apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is fully cross-play with friends across flatscreen and VR, so ho